@host = http://localhost:5100

### Movies through the catalog module
POST {{host}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"{ movies { title runtimeMinutes releasedOn } }"}

### Filtered and sorted
POST {{host}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"{ movies(where: { runtimeMinutes: { gt: 120 } }, order: [{ title: ASC }]) { title } }"}

### Readiness, per-module status and pending migrations
GET {{host}}/health

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/alive
